{"t":"Necromancer Halls","s":"necromancer-halls-182fc","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Cave_Rat_f0f59a.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The <b>Necromancer Halls</b> is a large area below <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a> inhabitated by various Necromancers. It was implemented in July 2013 when <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a> was revamped. The area plays a dominant role for <a href=\"#/quest/the-gravedigger-of-drefia-quest\">The Gravedigger of Drefia Quest</a>. To get there go to the northern part of <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a> and down the large ruins, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32996,32411,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32996, 32411, 7)</a>. After going down three times you will find yourself in the Necromancer Halls, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33003,32413,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33003, 32413, 10)</a>.\n</p><p>Note: it is wise to start <a href=\"#/wiki/Lugri\">Lugri</a>'s task of killing 4,000 <a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer\">Necromancers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Priestess\">Priestesses</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Hand\">Blood Hands</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Priest\">Blood Priests</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadow%20Pupil\">Shadow Pupils</a> when hunting here.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Rat\"><img alt=\"Cave Rat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loadi